        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Harukanaru Toki no Naka de 4",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Harukanaru Toki no Naka de 4, follows Chihiro Ashihara, one of two princesses of a kingdom locatrd in a land called Nakatsu Kuni within the parallel world. During her childhood, the kingdom was invaded by forces led by the king of Tokoyo no Kuni, a distant rival land connected to her kingdom. As Nakatsu Kuni is quickly overwhelmed, a divine power sends the protagonist through space-time to the modern world, protecting her from her kingdom's slaughter and ruin.\n\nFive years have passed since the massacre and the protagonist has suppressed her memories of her true origins. She believes she has been raised in the modern world and enjoys her peaceful life as an average high school student. Yet a mysterious encounter she has after school soon forces her to remember her true past and birthright. Returning to her home world, the protagonist is determined to save her people and resurrect her dying kingdom.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En Harukanaru Toki no Naka de 4, seguimos a Chihiro Ashihara, una de las dos princesas de un reino situado en una tierra llamada Nakatsu Kuni, dentro de un mundo paralelo. Durante su infancia, el reino fue invadido por las fuerzas lideradas por el rey de Tokoyo no Kuni, una tierra rival lejana conectada con su reino. Mientras Nakatsu Kuni es rápidamente abrumado, un poder divino envía a la protagonista a través del espacio-tiempo hacia el mundo moderno, protegiéndola de la matanza y la ruina de su reino.\n\nHan pasado cinco años desde la masacre y la protagonista ha reprimido sus recuerdos sobre sus verdaderos orígenes. Cree que se ha criado en el mundo moderno y disfruta de su vida tranquila como una estudiante de secundaria común. Sin embargo, un misterioso encuentro que tiene después de clase pronto la obliga a recordar su verdadero pasado y su linaje. Al regresar a su mundo natal, la protagonista está decidida a salvar a su pueblo y a resucitar su reino moribundo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
